cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite this reconstruction, please cite it as below. The argument and
  the formal Lean proof archive that it reconstructs originate with Levent
  Alpöge and Claude (Anthropic); please cite Alpöge's note for the argument
  itself (see "references").
type: software
title: >-
  The Alpöge Proof of the Riemann Hypothesis
abstract: >-
  A reconstruction in conventional mathematics of the proof of the Riemann
  hypothesis that Levent Alpöge announced on November 20, 2026, found in
  collaboration with Claude and released as a Lean development, which the
  Lean and Mathlib communities certified on November 21, 2026. The manuscript
  follows the original argument through the final deduction and records the
  mathematical comparisons and input proofs still under review.
version: "2026-11-25"
